### Searching at a provider.

## Why the words a list is narrowed by cannot be used.

search-control-characters = the query has control characters
# The term is in quotes, as it was typed.
search-no-value = { $term } has no value
# The term is in quotes, as it was typed.
search-too-many-values = { $term } has more than { $most } values
search-value-too-long = a value is longer than { $most } bytes
search-too-many-terms = the query has more than { $most } terms
search-too-many-searches = the query has too many alternatives: at most { $most } searches are made
